ECCode
======

ECCode is an independent implementation. It contains no source code or prompt
text copied from other projects.

Inspiration and attribution
---------------------------
Several workflow ideas were adapted from ECC (Everything Claude Code) by
Affaan Mustafa — https://github.com/affaan-m/ECC — studied at v2.2.3
(commit ef648e01899ba3e8dc6371642deaaf64b4477775). Adapted ideas include:
gated pipeline phases (skills/orch-pipeline), dual independent review
(commands/santa-loop.md), fail-closed review verification
(workflows/orch-review.workflow.js), a prompt-defense preamble for agents,
project-scoped learning (skills/continuous-learning-v2), and hook kill
switches (scripts/lib/hook-flags.js). See docs/ecc-assessment.md.

